  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>...</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>. If<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> equals _______.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>....</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now, using the sum of G.P formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>Now, finding the sum of coefficients we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>∑</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>by taking </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, on comparing both side we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
